WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:05.140
Welcome to the Singularity Daily, Friday edition.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.010
Here's your day in superintelligence, in 3 minutes flat.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.750
Anthropic went public today, and its shares opened at $111.50, up 34%.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.700
At that price, Claude's maker is worth about $2 trillion.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.140
At the opening bell,

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:37.880
its boss Dario Amodei promised to pace AI and keep it under human control.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.700
He started with his dad,

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.340
who died of a disease that became curable just a few years later.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:47.650
In Shenzhen,

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:53.320
President Trump told Asia-Pacific leaders America leads the world in superintelligence.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:57.860
His take: "It's almost completely good, but it's got some bad elements."

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.130
South Korea's exports just passed $1 trillion this year,

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.980
on the back of AI chips.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.670
Over in China, Alibaba says it's training its next Qwen model on its own chips.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.770
And Nvidia's headhunters have reportedly approached Arm's boss,

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:21.230
Rene Haas, about replacing Jensen Huang.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:28.260
Oh, and ChatGPT now types your words as you say them, with no 10-minute limit.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.350
Merck teamed up with Isomorphic Labs, Demis Hassabis's drug company,

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:37.030
to design cancer drug candidates with AI.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.140
And Britain's first brain implant centre,

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:43.230
in Newcastle, just got over £6 million to grow.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.840
The catch? The European Commission says hackers used AI to attack it last month.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:55.640
Meta's emissions jumped 45%. Now it's rethinking its climate goal.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.370
So... is it so over?

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.450
We're so back!

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:05.030
Google picked Blue Origin's New Glenn rocket to

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:08.190
launch its AI server satellites in early 2029.

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:13.630
Elon Musk says Tesla plans a Model Y with no steering wheel,

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:15.410
for six or seven riders.

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.630
Science Corp raised $400 million for an eye

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:22.380
implant that helps some blind people read.

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:27.650
Superintelligence is going public. So the public should get a say.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.670
Every day, the curve gets a little steeper.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.540
And the future keeps arriving ahead of schedule.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.880
One day, all of this. Tomorrow, probably more.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.230
That's the Singularity Daily for today.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:49.940
See you tomorrow.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.010
Want the whole month? Hear more on November 27.
